<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>Privacy Policy - GridPermit</title>
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
	<nav class="navbar"><div class="nav-container"><a href="/" class="brand-logo">Grid<strong>Permit</strong></a></div></nav>
	<main class="legal-container">
		<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p class="updated">Last Updated: July 2026 (v3.0)</p>

		<p>At GridPermit, we are committed to protecting your privacy and complying with California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) guidelines.</p>

		<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
		<p>When you use our payback calculator or request quote matches, we collect your ZIP code, estimated electric bill, full name, email address, and phone number.</p>

		<h2>2. How We Use & Share Information</h2>
		<p>By submitting your request, you authorize us to match you with up to three licensed California solar installation partners to provide customized audits and estimates.</p>

		<h2>3. Exercising Your California Rights (CCPA)</h2>
		<p>You have the right to request access to or deletion of your personal information at any time. To exercise your rights, submit a request via email to privacy@gridpermit.com or contact us at our legal address below.</p>

		<h2>4. Business Contact & Operator Identity</h2>
		<p>GridPermit is operated as an independent lead referral platform.<br/>
		Email: support@gridpermit.com / privacy@gridpermit.com<br/>
		Address: GridPermit Media LLC, 30 N Gould St, Sheridan, WY 82801</p>

		<a href="/" class="btn-back">Back to Calculator</a>
	</main>
	<style>
		:root { --primary: #2563eb; --bg: #f8fafc; --text: #0f172a; }
		body { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }
		.navbar { background: white; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 1rem 2rem; }
		.nav-container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
		.brand-logo { text-decoration: none; color: var(--text); font-size: 1.5rem; }
		.legal-container { max-width: 800px; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
		h1 { font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
		.updated { color: #64748b; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
		h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
		p { color: #334155; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
		.btn-back { display: inline-block; margin-top: 2rem; color: var(--primary); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
	</style>
</body>
</html>
